<title>USA: TABLE - Rayonier Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Rayonier Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(millions of dollars, except per share information)</p>
<p>			    Second Quarter Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,		June 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	 1996	1997	1996</p>
<p>Profitability</p>
<p>    Sales		    $290.1    $296.7    $550.2    $590.6</p>
<p>    Operating income	 41.1	32.9	81.5	92.8</p>
<p>    Net income		 19.8	15.4	38.2	46.9</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
