<p>a percentage of</p>
<p>     sales		    14.2%     11.1%     14.8%     15.7%</p>
<p>    ROE (annualized)	12.7%	7.8%     12.3%     12.0%</p>
<p>Capital Resources</p>
<p> and Liquidity EBITDA	58.2	49.4     115.8     126.0</p>
<p>Decrease/(increase)</p>
